@startuml
title Schatten - Prediction Request Lifecycle

hide empty description

[*] --> queued : validated snapshot committed
queued --> running : lock-owning worker claims oldest request
queued --> cancelled : cancel accepted immediately
running --> cancelling : cancel accepted
cancelling --> cancelled : child stopped, reaped; output discarded
running --> failed : unexpected error, crash or lost ownership
running --> completed : atomic complete-version publication commits first

note right of queued
  Name reserved.
  Survives container restarts.
  Claimed only after migrations succeed.
end note

note right of running
  One global worker; child calculates
  only from frozen detached snapshot.
end note

note right of cancelling
  Supervisor checks each second,
  terminates, then force-kills after
  two seconds if necessary.
end note

note bottom of completed
  Immutable version exists.
  Later cancellation returns completed.
end note

note bottom of cancelled
  Name is reusable.
  No saved version from this request.
end note

note bottom of failed
  Safe failure retained; no retry.
  Name is reusable; no partial version.
  Startup recovers abandoned running here.
end note
@enduml
